Explain the Terraform workflow.

Answer (English):

Write Terraform configuration (.tf files).
Run terraform init to initialize the project.
Run terraform validate to check the configuration.
Run terraform fmt to format the code.
Run terraform plan to preview changes.
Run terraform apply to create or update infrastructure.
Run terraform output to view output values.
Run terraform destroy to remove infrastructure when no longer needed.

मराठी:

.tf फाइलमध्ये कोड लिहा.
terraform init चालवा.
terraform validate ने Syntax तपासा.
terraform fmt ने कोड Format करा.
terraform plan ने होणारे बदल पाहा.
terraform apply ने Infrastructure तयार करा.
terraform output ने Outputs पाहा.
गरज संपल्यावर terraform destroy ने Resources हटवा.
